          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
          <span>Pediatric Scope Limitation (Under 18)</span>
        </h5>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body p-4 text-center">
        <div class="brand-icon-box mx-auto mb-3 text-danger" style="width: 56px; height: 56px; background-color: #fee2e2;">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="4.93" y1="4.93" x2="19.07" y2="19.07"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Subject Under 18 Detected</h3>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
          NutriRisk AI is specifically calibrated, validated, and clinically designed for <strong>adult populations aged 18 and older</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="alert alert-warning text-start small border border-warning-subtle mb-3">
          <strong>Clinical Protocol Warning:</strong> Pediatric malnutrition assessment cannot be accurately evaluated using adult Body Mass Index (BMI) formulas. Pediatric screening requires <strong>WHO Child Growth Standards</strong> (weight-for-age, height-for-age z-scores, and Mid-Upper Arm Circumference [MUAC]).
        </div>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-0">
          To maintain clinical safety and ethical standards, this screening cannot be processed for an underage subject.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer bg-light border-0 justify-content-center gap-2 py-3">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm px-3" id="btnResetAge" data-bs-dismiss="modal">
          Clear Age
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary-teal btn-sm px-4" id="btnSetAge18" data-bs-dismiss="modal">
          Set Age to 18 (Minimum Adult)
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
